{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人蔡思貝自從於電影《功夫女足》合作後，繼續食「周星馳效應」，昨日（21日）她於社交網化身美食博主拍片，介紹香港隱藏燒味店。</p><p>她留言：「來保齡球館扔球？</p><p>不，吃飯！</p><p>」片中她現身保齡球場，但並非打波，而是到球道旁的燒味店開餐，她甫入座即落柯打，細</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.929937+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_hash":"1f172965304a118a672fc80b3696a166ee05980ced4748d98ec849a330dbca3c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}